<item>
<feedburner:origLink>https://www.fortinet.com/blog/psirt-blogs/advancing-responsible-disclosure-efforts-a-qa-with-michael-daniel-of-cta</feedburner:origLink><title>Advancing Responsible Disclosure Efforts: A Q&amp;A with Michael Daniel of Cyber Threat Alliance</title><description><![CDATA[The Cyber Threat Alliance introduced its Responsible Vulnerability Communication Policy, laying out guidelines for responsibly handling disclosed vulnerabilities in any product or system in a way that optimizes secure outcomes. Fortinet proudly supports CTA’s adoption of this policy as part of our ongoing commitment to advancing transparent and responsible vulnerability disclosure to help better protect customers and build trust across the industry.<div style="clear:both;padding-top:0.2em;"><a title="Subscribe by email" href="https://feeds.fortinet.com/_/19/914615195/fortinet/blog/psirt"><img height="20" src="https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png" style="border:0;margin:0;padding:0;"></a>&#160;<a title="Subscribe by RSS" href="https://feeds.fortinet.com/_/20/914615195/fortinet/blog/psirt"><img height="20" src="https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png" style="border:0;margin:0;padding:0;"></a>&nbsp;&#160;</div>]]>
</description><link>https://feeds.fortinet.com/~/914615195/0/fortinet/blog/psirt~Advancing-Responsible-Disclosure-Efforts-A-QA-with-Michael-Daniel-of-Cyber-Threat-Alliance</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Mar 2025 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The Cyber Threat Alliance introduced its Responsible Vulnerability Communication Policy, laying out guidelines for responsibly handling disclosed vulnerabilities in any product or system in a way that optimizes secure outcomes. Fortinet proudly supports CTA’s adoption of this policy as part of our ongoing commitment to advancing transparent and responsible vulnerability disclosure to help better protect customers and build trust across the industry.</p><Img align="left" border="0" height="1" width="1" alt="" style="border:0;float:left;margin:0;padding:0;width:1px!important;height:1px!important;" hspace="0" src="https://feeds.fortinet.com/~/i/914615195/0/fortinet/blog/psirt">
