<feedburner:origLink>https://www.fortinet.com/blog/psirt-blogs/analysis-of-cve-2023-27997-and-clarifications-on-volt-typhoon-campaign</feedburner:origLink><title>Analysis of CVE-2023-27997 and Clarifications on Volt Typhoon Campaign </title><description><![CDATA[Today, Fortinet published a CVSS Critical PSIRT Advisory (FG-IR-23-097 / CVE-2023-27997) along with several other SSL-VPN related fixes. This blog adds context to that advisory, providing our customers with additional details to help them make informed, risk-based decisions, and provides our perspective relative to recent events involving malicious actor activity.<div style="clear:both;padding-top:0.2em;"><a title="Subscribe by email" href="https://feeds.fortinet.com/_/19/745680218/fortinet/blog/psirt"><img height="20" src="https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png" style="border:0;margin:0;padding:0;"></a>&#160;<a title="Subscribe by RSS" href="https://feeds.fortinet.com/_/20/745680218/fortinet/blog/psirt"><img height="20" src="https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png" style="border:0;margin:0;padding:0;"></a>&nbsp;&#160;</div>]]>
